### GET ALL RESTAURANTS Happy path
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### GET ALL RESTAURANTS Bad credentials
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants
Authorization: Basic admin1 admin11
Accept: application/json

### GET ONE RESTAURANT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### GET ONE RESTAURANT Bad Credentials
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### DELETE ONE RESTAURANT
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### CREATE ONE RESTAURANT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "name4",
  "description": "d4"
}
### UPDATE ONE RESTAURANT
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "name": "name22",
  "description": "d22"
}

